  description: "[ Pendulum Effect ] \nYour opponent cannot activate a Spell/Trap
    Card, or monster effect, when your \"Solfachord\" Pendulum Monster(s) is Pendulum
    Summoned.\n\n[ Monster Effect ] \nWhile you have an odd Pendulum Scale in your
    Pendulum Zone, if your \"Solfachord\" Pendulum Monster attacks, your opponent
    cannot activate Spell/Trap Cards or effects until the end of the Damage Step.
    During your Main Phase: You can Tribute 1 \"Solfachord\" Pendulum Monster (even
    if face-down), and if you do, Special Summon 1 \"Solfachord\" Pendulum Monster
    from your Deck whose Pendulum Scale is 2 higher or 2 lower than that monster,
    except \"LaSolfachord Angelia\". You can only use this effect of \"LaSolfachord
    Angelia\" once per turn."
